   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "A box weighing <span data-math=\"500\\,\\text{N}\">500\\,\\text{N}</span> is at rest on the floor. A person pushes against it and it starts moving when <span data-math=\"100\\,\\text{N}\">100\\,\\text{N}</span> force is applied to it. What can be said about the coefficient of kinetic friction between the box and the floor?",
